sequenceDiagram
    actor O as Owner
    actor Any as Anyone
    participant H as TrancheJITHook
    participant P as TranchePipeModule
    participant C as TrancheAccountant
    participant SV as SeniorVault
    participant JV as JuniorVault
    actor Hold as Senior / Junior holders

    O->>H: setExpiry(timestamp) — one-shot, future-only
    Note over H: expired() ⇒ quoteState = Rest<br/>swaps revert · JIT + rebalancing stop · deposits and new requests close
    Any->>P: settleSwap(equityIn, minUsdcOut, deadline)
    P->>P: equity → USDC at the oracle floor, permissionless and oracle-bounded
    Any->>P: finalizeSettlement()
    P->>C: seniorGuaranteeUsdc() — principal + escrow, oracle-free
    Note over P: requires usdcUnits ≥ guarantee OR equityUnits = 0, else SettlementNotReady
    P->>H: unwindClaims()
    P->>H: moduleBurn for both vault hook-share balances
    P->>SV: modulePull USDC up to the guarantee
    P->>JV: modulePull remaining USDC + all equity
    P->>SV: creditSettlement(usdcToSenior, 0)
    P->>JV: creditSettlement(usdcToJunior, equityUnits)
    P->>P: settled = true — one-shot
    Note over SV,JV: terminal per-share rates frozen — usdcPerShare1e18 / equityPerShare1e18
    Hold->>SV: redeemAtExpiry(shares, receiver) or redeem()
    Hold->>JV: redeemAtExpiry(shares, receiver) or redeem()
    Note over P: if the USDC leg cannot be completed, owner fallback finalizeSettlementHaircut()
